		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top;">
			<td style="width: 3%;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(1)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Value calculated as the number of unearned units multiplied by the closing price of the Company&#8217;s common stock on the Nasdaq Capital Market at December 31, 2025 of $3.09 per share.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#160;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

