			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Restricted stock units, with a grant date of November 3, 2025, vest one-third annually over a three-year vesting period, provided that the NEO remains in continuous service with us through each vesting date. Represent a new hire inducement grant.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#160;</p>

<table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px;">

