			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Performance stock units, with a grant date of June 12, 2025, vest in three equal tranches at such time or times prior to June 12, 2028 that certain common stock price appreciation metrics are achieved, provided that the NEO remains in continuous service with us through each vesting date.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

