			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Restricted stock units, with a grant date of June 20, 2024, vest one-third annually over a three-year vesting period, provided that the NEO remains in continuous service with us through each vesting date.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 3%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(7)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the Transition Agreement, Mr. Brdar&#8217;s outstanding restricted stock units held as of the date of the Transition Agreement vested as to fifty percent (50%) on January 3, 2026 (with those RSUs having the earliest grant date vesting first) and as to the remaining fifty percent (50%) on April 3, 2026, subject to Mr. Brdar&#8217;s continued service to the Company as set forth in his Transition Agreement.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 3%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(8)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the Transition Agreement, these performance stock units will remain outstanding and eligible to vest through the twelve (12) month transition period contemplated by the Transition Agreement in accordance with the performance vesting terms applicable to such performance stock units. Any performance stock units that do not vest during such transition period will be automatically forfeited.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#160;</p>

<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; text-indent: 0px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt;">

		<tbody><tr style="vertical-align: top; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<td style="width: 3%; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">(9)</p>
			</td>
			<td style="width: 97%; padding-bottom: 5px; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt;">
			<p style="font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif;font-size: 10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Pursuant to the Transition Agreement, outstanding stock options will remain exercisable until three (3) months after termination of services under this Transition Agreement, subject to earlier termination in the event of a corporate transaction as set forth in the Company&#8217;s Amended and Restated 2013 Equity Incentive Plan.</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#160;</p>

<div class="PGBK" style="width: 100%; margin-left: 0pt; margin-right: 0pt">
<div class="PGFTR" style="text-align: center; width: 100%">
<div class="hf-row">
<div class="hf-cell PGNUM" style="text-align: center; font-size: 10pt; font-family: Times New Roman;">19</div>
</div>
</div>

<hr style="PAGE-BREAK-AFTER: always; border: none; width: 100%; height: 2px; color: #000000; background-color: #000000"/>
