			<p style="font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;, Times, serif; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">CAP reflects the exclusions and inclusions of certain amounts for the Second PEO as set forth below. Equity values are calculated in accordance with FASB ASC Topic 718. Amounts in the Exclusion of Stock Awards for Second PEO column are the totals from the Stock Awards column set forth in the Summary Compensation Table. Amounts in the Inclusion of Equity Values for Second PEO are derived from the second table in this footnote.</p>
