			<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">Assumes $100 was invested for the period starting December 31, 2022, through the end of the listed year in the Company. Historical stock performance is not necessarily indicative of future stock performance.</p>
